00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.740 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le plus haut tribunal du pays

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:07.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
clarifie des concepts importants

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.176 size:53% position:73% line:53%
